• The registry will be fail-closed in the small-step relation: an unregistered primitive has no accepted answer and therefore no `Step`. Each registered contract also carries an executable answer checker proved equivalent to its full Lean-level contract, so accepted answers yield their postconditions by proof rather than by convention.

